<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<title>ctxray — {{.SessionID}}</title>
<style>
  /*
    Palette: the dataviz skill's validated default (references/palette.md).
    Five fixed categorical slots, assigned in order — never generated per
    tool name, so the report never grows past a small, memorizable set of
    colors no matter how many distinct MCP tools a session used.
  */
  :root {
    color-scheme: light dark;
    --surface:      #fcfcfb;
    --page:         #f9f9f7;
    --border:       rgba(11,11,11,0.10);
    --ink:          #0b0b0b;
    --ink-2:        #52514e;
    --ink-muted:    #898781;
    --gridline:     #e1e0d9;

    --slot-user:     #2a78d6;
    --slot-bash:     #eb6834;
    --slot-read:     #1baf7a;
    --slot-grep:     #eda100;
    --slot-other:    #4a3aa7;
    --slot-overhead: #898781;
    --slot-dead:      #d03b3b;
    --slot-dead-bg:   #fbeceb;
    --slot-dead-chip: #f6d2d0;

    --sans: system-ui, -apple-system, "Segoe UI", Roboto, sans-serif;
    --mono: ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, "Cascadia Code", "JetBrains Mono", Consolas, monospace;
  }
  @media (prefers-color-scheme: dark) {
    :root {
      --surface:   #1a1a19;
      --page:      #0d0d0d;
      --border:    rgba(255,255,255,0.10);
      --ink:       #ffffff;
      --ink-2:     #c3c2b7;
      --ink-muted: #898781;
      --gridline:  #2c2c2a;

      --slot-user:  #3987e5;
      --slot-bash:  #d95926;
      --slot-read:  #199e70;
      --slot-grep:  #c98500;
      --slot-other: #9085e9;
      --slot-dead-bg: #2a1414;
      --slot-dead-chip: #4a2020;
    }
  }
  * { box-sizing: border-box; }
  body {
    margin: 0;
    padding: 40px 20px 64px;
    background: var(--page);
    color: var(--ink);
    font-family: var(--sans);
    line-height: 1.45;
    -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;
  }
  main { max-width: 1080px; margin: 0 auto; }

  header { margin-bottom: 32px; }
  header h1 { font-size: 20px; margin: 0 0 4px; letter-spacing: -.01em; }
  header .sub { color: var(--ink-muted); font-size: 13px; font-family: var(--mono); }

  h2 {
    font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: .06em;
    color: var(--ink-muted); font-weight: 600; margin: 40px 0 12px;
  }
  .caption { font-size: 13px; color: var(--ink-muted); margin: -6px 0 12px; }

  .panel {
    background: var(--surface);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: 12px;
    padding: 18px 20px;
  }

  /* ---------- stat tiles ---------- */
  .stats-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr); gap: 10px; }
  .stat-card {
    background: var(--surface);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: 12px;
    padding: 14px 16px;
  }
  .stat-card .n { font-size: 21px; font-weight: 600; font-variant-numeric: normal; }
  .stat-card .l { color: var(--ink-muted); font-size: 12px; margin-top: 3px; }
  .stat-card.hero {
    background: var(--slot-dead-bg);
    border-color: var(--slot-dead);
    grid-column: span 4;
    padding: 24px 26px;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: space-between;
    gap: 20px;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
  }
  .stat-card.hero .hero-main { display: flex; align-items: baseline; gap: 18px; flex-wrap: wrap; }
  .stat-card.hero .n { color: var(--slot-dead); font-size: 52px; font-weight: 700; line-height: 1; letter-spacing: -.01em; }
  .stat-card.hero .l { color: var(--ink-2); font-size: 14.5px; max-width: 44ch; }
  .stat-card.hero .pct {
    flex: none;
    background: var(--slot-dead-chip);
    color: var(--slot-dead);
    border-radius: 999px;
    padding: 7px 14px;
    font-size: 15px;
    font-weight: 700;
    white-space: nowrap;
  }
  @media (max-width: 720px) {
    .stats-grid { grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr); }
    .stat-card { grid-column: span 1; }
    .stat-card.hero { grid-column: span 2; }
  }

  /* ---------- timeline ---------- */
  .timeline svg { width: 100%; height: 130px; display: block; overflow: visible; }
  .ctxray-timeline-area { fill: var(--slot-user); fill-opacity: .10; }
  .ctxray-timeline-line { fill: none; stroke: var(--slot-user); stroke-width: 2; stroke-linecap: round; stroke-linejoin: round; }

  /* ---------- legend ---------- */
  .legend { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 6px 18px; margin: 16px 2px 0; font-size: 12.5px; color: var(--ink-2); }
  .legend .item { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 6px; }
  .dot { width: 9px; height: 9px; border-radius: 2.5px; display: inline-block; flex: none; }

  /* ---------- biggest dead weight: a plain sorted list, no chart to learn ---------- */
  .top-dead { list-style: none; margin: 0; padding: 0; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 2px; }
  .top-dead li {
    display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px;
    padding: 8px 4px; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--gridline);
    font-size: 13.5px;
  }
  .top-dead li:last-child { border-bottom: none; }
  .top-dead .rank-label { flex: 1; color: var(--ink-2); overflow: hidden; text-overflow: ellipsis; white-space: nowrap; }
  .top-dead .rank-tokens { flex: none; font-family: var(--mono); font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; font-weight: 600; color: var(--slot-dead); }

  /* ---------- flamegraph ---------- */
  .flame-rows { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 2px; }
  .turn-row {
    display: grid; grid-template-columns: 52px 1fr;
    align-items: center; gap: 10px;
    font-family: var(--mono); font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; font-size: 11px;
  }
  .turn-row .delta { color: var(--ink-muted); text-align: right; }
  /* The track is the full-width lane every row shares, so rows stay
     comparable; the bar inside it is sized to this turn's actual share
     of the session's biggest turn — length carries magnitude the way a
     real flamegraph does, not just a text label next to a full-width
     bar every time. */
  .turn-track { height: 20px; border-radius: 4px; overflow: hidden; background: var(--gridline); }
  .turn-bar { display: flex; height: 100%; }

  .block { position: relative; height: 100%; min-width: 1px; transition: filter .1s ease; }
  .block:not(:first-child) { box-shadow: inset 1.5px 0 0 var(--surface); }
  .block:hover, .block:focus-visible { filter: brightness(1.14); outline: none; }
  .block:focus-visible { box-shadow: inset 0 0 0 1.5px var(--ink); }

  .slot-user     { background: var(--slot-user); }
  .slot-bash     { background: var(--slot-bash); }
  .slot-read     { background: var(--slot-read); }
  .slot-grep     { background: var(--slot-grep); }
  .slot-other    { background: var(--slot-other); }
  .slot-overhead { background: var(--slot-overhead); opacity: .5; }

  /* Dead is a status overlay, not a slot color — it rides on top of
     whichever category the block already has, so the reader still sees
     what kind of content it was AND that it's flagged, at once. */
  .block.dead::after {
    content: "";
    position: absolute; inset: 0;
    background-image: repeating-linear-gradient(
      45deg, transparent 0 3px, var(--slot-dead) 3px 4.5px
    );
    opacity: .8;
    pointer-events: none;
  }

  /* ---------- tool calls table ---------- */
  table.toolcalls { width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; font-size: 13px; }
  table.toolcalls td { padding: 7px 8px; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--gridline); }
  table.toolcalls tr:last-child td { border-bottom: none; }
  table.toolcalls td.name { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px; }
  table.toolcalls td.n { text-align: right; color: var(--ink-muted); font-family: var(--mono); font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }

  footer {
    margin-top: 52px; padding-top: 18px; border-top: 1px solid var(--gridline);
    color: var(--ink-muted); font-size: 12.5px; line-height: 1.6;
  }
  footer a { color: var(--ink-2); }
  footer strong { color: var(--ink-2); }
  .credit { margin-top: 10px; font-family: var(--mono); }
</style>
</head>
<body>
<main>
  <header>
    <h1>ctxray</h1>
    <div class="sub">session {{.SessionID}} · {{.Models}} · generated {{.GeneratedAt}}</div>
  </header>

  <section class="stats-grid">
    <div class="stat-card hero">
      <div class="hero-main">
        <div class="n">{{.Stats.DeadTokensExact}}</div>
        <div class="l">dead tokens — burned across {{.Stats.DeadTokenBlocks}} tool result(s) that entered the context window and were never mentioned again</div>
      </div>
      <div class="pct">{{.Stats.DeadTokenPct}} of everything entered</div>
    </div>
    <div class="stat-card"><div class="n">{{.Stats.TurnCount}}</div><div class="l">turns</div></div>
    <div class="stat-card"><div class="n">{{.Stats.Duration}}</div><div class="l">{{.Stats.StartClock}} → {{.Stats.EndClock}}</div></div>
    <div class="stat-card"><div class="n">{{.Stats.PeakContextTokens}}</div><div class="l">peak context window</div></div>
    <div class="stat-card"><div class="n">{{.Stats.TotalOutputTokens}}</div><div class="l">output tokens ({{.Stats.TotalThinkingTokens}} thinking)</div></div>
  </section>

  {{if .TopDead}}
  <h2>Biggest dead weight</h2>
  <div class="panel">
    <ol class="top-dead">
      {{range .TopDead}}<li><span class="dot slot-{{.Slot}}"></span><span class="rank-label">{{.Label}}</span><span class="rank-tokens">{{.Tokens}}</span></li>{{end}}
    </ol>
  </div>
  {{end}}

  <h2>Context window over the session</h2>
  <div class="panel timeline">
    <svg viewBox="0 0 1000 160" preserveAspectRatio="none">{{.TimelineSVG}}</svg>
  </div>

  <h2>Where the tokens came from, turn by turn</h2>
  <p class="caption">Bar length is how much this turn added, relative to the session's biggest turn. Color is where it came from. Red hatch is flagged dead. Showing {{len .Turns}} of {{.Stats.TurnCount}} turns — the rest added nothing new to the window.</p>
  <div class="panel">
    <div class="flame-rows">
      {{range .Turns}}
      <div class="turn-row" title="{{.RowTitle}}">
        <span class="delta">{{.DeltaLabel}}</span>
        <div class="turn-track">
          <div class="turn-bar" style="width:{{printf "%.3f" .RowWidthPct}}%;">
            {{range .Blocks}}<span class="block slot-{{.Slot}}{{if .Dead}} dead{{end}}" style="width:{{printf "%.3f" .WidthPct}}%;" title="{{.Title}}" tabindex="0"></span>{{end}}
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
      {{end}}
    </div>
    <div class="legend">
      {{range .Legend}}<span class="item"><span class="dot slot-{{.Slot}}"></span>{{.Label}}</span>{{end}}
      <span class="item"><span class="dot" style="background-image:repeating-linear-gradient(45deg,var(--slot-dead) 0 2px,transparent 2px 4px);"></span>flagged dead</span>
    </div>
  </div>

  <h2>Tool calls</h2>
  <div class="panel">
    <table class="toolcalls">
      {{range .ToolCalls}}<tr><td class="name"><span class="dot slot-{{.Slot}}"></span>{{.Name}}</td><td class="n">{{.Count}}</td></tr>{{end}}
    </table>
  </div>

  <footer>
    <div><strong>Ceiling:</strong> token counts under ~1,000 are estimated from character length (≈4 chars/token) and scaled to match what Anthropic actually billed that turn — attribution, not an exact tokenizer. "Dead" means none of a block's distinctive words showed up in the assistant's reply that turn or any later one; a block can matter without being quoted back, so read the percentage as a lead to check on specific turns, not a verdict. Tooltips are hover-only — there's no table view yet, so exact per-block numbers live in the title attribute, not on the page.</div>
    <div class="credit">generated by <a href="https://github.com/Gabriel-Gerhardt/ctxray">ctxray</a></div>
  </footer>
</main>
</body>
</html>
